{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":"2026-06-12T12:31:20.510Z","tool_name":"update_topic","tool_id":"update_topic__1rox7626","parameters":{"summary":"Research phase is complete. I confirmed that structural pseudo-classes (:first-child, :last-child, :nth-child, and :nth-last-child) are partially parsed in separate ways (some into components, some as format strings). I will refactor src/selector/matching.rs to introduce clean helper functions for these four pseudo-classes, and use them to handle matches_component (Component::FirstChild, Component::LastChild, Component::NthChild) as well as Component::PseudoClass. Finally, I will add unit tests to verify correctness.","title":"Implementing Structural Pseudo-Classes","strategic_intent":"Refactoring matching.rs to add is_first_child, is_last_child, nth_child, and nth_last_child helpers, and wiring them into matches_component and PseudoClass matching arms."}}
{"type":"tool_result","timestamp":"2026-06-12T12:31:20.575Z","tool_id":"update_topic__1rox7626","status":"success","output":"## 📂 Topic: **Implementing Structural Pseudo-Classes**\n\n**Summary:**\nResearch phase is complete. I confirmed that structural pseudo-classes (:first-child, :last-child, :nth-child, and :nth-last-child) are partially parsed in separate ways (some into components, some as format strings). I will refactor src/selector/matching.rs to introduce clean helper functions for these four pseudo-classes, and use them to handle matches_component (Component::FirstChild, Component::LastChild, Component::NthChild) as well as Component::PseudoClass. Finally, I will add unit tests to verify correctness.\n\n> [!STRATEGY]\n> **Intent:** Refactoring matching.rs to add is_first_child, is_last_child, nth_child, and nth_last_child helpers, and wiring them into matches_component and PseudoClass matching arms."}
